{"path":"/ai-visibility-index/","slug":"ai-visibility-index","kind":"utility","title":"AI Visibility Index 2026 | 63 Brands, July Results","description":"AI Visibility Index 2026: 63 fintech and AI brands scored in July 2026, averaging 22/100. See the leading scores, market differences and the method.","source":"wayback","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/ai-visibility-index.MqgXFUQ-.css","/_astro/Base.Cz7aN_E5.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"idx-hero\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"idx-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q></div><div class=\"container idx-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Research</span><h1 class=\"idx-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The AI Visibility Index</h1><p class=\"idx-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>July 2026 results for 63 fintech and AI brands. The average AI visibility score was 22/100. See the leading brands, differences between markets and the source behind the scores.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"#july-results\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>See the July results</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"page-brief\" id=\"july-results\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div class=\"container page-brief__inner\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div data-astro-cid-onysphra><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>July 2026 · worldwide</span><h2 data-astro-cid-onysphra>Leading scores in the July edition</h2></div><div class=\"page-brief__body\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><p data-astro-cid-onysphra>Wise and Adyen had the two highest worldwide scores among the 63 brands in this edition. These are Semrush AI Visibility scores out of 100, not a percentage of all AI answers or a measure of revenue.</p><table class=\"idx-results\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><caption data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>AI Visibility Index 2026: published scores from the 63-brand July edition</caption><thead data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><tr data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><th scope=\"col\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Brand</th><th scope=\"col\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Worldwide /100</th><th scope=\"col\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>US /100</th></tr></thead><tbody data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><tr data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><th scope=\"row\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Wise</th><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>78</td><td class=\"idx-results__na\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Not published</td></tr><tr data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><th scope=\"row\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Adyen</th><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>45</td><td class=\"idx-results__na\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Not published</td></tr><tr data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><th scope=\"row\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Chime</th><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>39</td><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>74</td></tr><tr data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><th scope=\"row\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Plaid</th><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>28</td><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>64</td></tr><tr data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><th scope=\"row\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Ramp</th><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>27</td><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>67</td></tr><tr data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><th scope=\"row\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Brex</th><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>26</td><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>64</td></tr></tbody><tfoot data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><tr data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><th scope=\"row\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Average of the 63 brands</th><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>22</td><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q></td></tr><tr data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><th scope=\"row\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Median of the 63 brands</th><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>19</td><td data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q></td></tr></tfoot></table><p class=\"idx-source\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Measured July 2026. Source: Semrush AI Visibility scores covering ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews and AI Mode, Perplexity and Gemini. Legency's edition covers 63 selected brands, four of them below the tracking threshold.</p><ul data-astro-cid-onysphra><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"#index-methodology\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Read the methodology<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/services/search-ai-visibility/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Explore our AI visibility service<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"section idx-what\" id=\"index-methodology\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The Index</span><h2 class=\"idx-what__heading\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>What the AI Visibility Index Measures</h2><p class=\"idx-what__intro\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Buyers increasingly open an AI assistant before they open a search results page. When they ask which KYC vendor to use or which treasury platform is best, the engine names a handful of companies. This edition compares the provider's visibility scores for a selected set of fintech and AI brands. Read the date, market and scoring method alongside the results. Our <a href=\"/answer-engine-optimization/\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>answer engine optimization</a> work also uses a separate client panel with dated answers to specific buyer questions.</p><div class=\"idx-what__grid\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><article class=\"idx-method-card\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 12.5C17.2761 12.5 17.5 12.2761 17.5 12C17.5 11.7239 17.2761 11.5 17 11.5C16.7239 11.5 16.5 11.7239 16.5 12C16.5 12.2761 16.7239 12.5 17 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 12.5C12.2761 12.5 12.5 12.2761 12.5 12C12.5 11.7239 12.2761 11.5 12 11.5C11.7239 11.5 11.5 11.7239 11.5 12C11.5 12.2761 11.7239 12.5 12 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M7 12.5C7.27614 12.5 7.5 12.2761 7.5 12C7.5 11.7239 7.27614 11.5 7 11.5C6.72386 11.5 6.5 11.7239 6.5 12C6.5 12.2761 6.72386 12.5 7 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 13.8214 2.48697 15.5291 3.33782 17L2.5 21.5L7 20.6622C8.47087 21.513 10.1786 22 12 22Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The Engines</h3><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The July edition uses Semrush AI Visibility data covering ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews and AI Mode, Perplexity and Gemini. Coverage can differ across engines and markets.</p></article><article class=\"idx-method-card\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The Questions</h3><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>This edition uses the questions and topic coverage available in the source dataset. It is separate from our client monitoring panel, where we record a defined set of buyer questions and the dated answers.</p></article><article class=\"idx-method-card\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The Score</h3><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Scores use the source provider’s 0 to 100 visibility scale. In the July sample, 14 was the lowest returned score and four brands fell below tracking. These are observations about this dataset, not a universal scoring threshold.</p></article><article class=\"idx-method-card\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14.2718 10.445L18 2M9.31612 10.6323L5 2M12.7615 10.0479L8.835 2M14.36 2L13.32 4.5M6 16C6 19.3137 8.68629 22 12 22C15.3137 22 18 19.3137 18 16C18 12.6863 15.3137 10 12 10C8.68629 10 6 12.6863 6 16Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The Benchmark</h3><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Every score sits beside its category best: the strongest sources answering those same questions today. In most categories that is a review site, a bank or a publisher rather than a vendor.</p></article></div><p class=\"idx-what__caveats\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>An AI brand index, or brand visibility index, compares a defined sample at a recorded time. The July results cannot establish conversion impact or predict the next answer a buyer sees. Geography, question selection and provider coverage can change the result. Our monthly client answer panel is a separate measurement and should be compared on its own terms.</p></div></section><section class=\"section idx-findings\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>July 2026 Edition</span><h2 class=\"idx-findings__heading\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Nobody Owns AI Search Yet</h2><p class=\"idx-findings__intro\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>We scored 63 B2B brands (this edition's category: fintech and AI) on how often each one appears when a buyer asks an AI engine which product to use. The category average came back at 22 out of 100. One brand has claimed its answer. Everyone else is still available.</p><div class=\"idx-stats\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"band-scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\"></div><div class=\"idx-stat\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"idx-stat__figure\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>22/100</span><span class=\"idx-stat__label\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Average score across the 63 brands measured</span></div><div class=\"idx-stat\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"idx-stat__figure\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>1 of 63</span><span class=\"idx-stat__label\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Scored above 50</span></div><div class=\"idx-stat\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"idx-stat__figure\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>19</span><span class=\"idx-stat__label\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Median score out of 100</span></div><div class=\"idx-stat\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"idx-stat__figure\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>56 of 59</span><span class=\"idx-stat__label\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Scored brands sitting below their own category best</span></div></div><div class=\"idx-findings__grid\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><article class=\"idx-finding\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><h3 data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>One brand in 63 owns its answer.</h3><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Wise scores 78 out of 100. The next best, Adyen, sits at 45, and every other brand in the index is under 40. Wise is also the only one of the 63 that outperforms the strongest answer sources in its own category.</p></article><article class=\"idx-finding\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><h3 data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Strong US brands go quiet worldwide.</h3><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Chime scores 74 in the US and 39 worldwide. Ramp scores 67 against 27, Plaid 64 against 28, Brex 64 against 26. The answer a buyer gets changes with the continent they are asking from, and almost nobody defends both.</p></article><article class=\"idx-finding\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><h3 data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Somebody else is answering the buying questions.</h3><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>56 of the 59 scored brands sit below the strongest answer sources in their own category. Review sites, banks and publishers hold those answers today, which means the vendor is absent from the moment the buyer is deciding.</p></article><article class=\"idx-finding\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><h3 data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Whole categories are unclaimed.</h3><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Treasury, KYC, WealthTech and RegTech all average in the teens. The first brand to claim one of those categories becomes the default answer inside it, and defaults compound with every answer that gets generated.</p></article></div><div class=\"idx-bands\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><h3 class=\"idx-bands__title\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Where the 63 brands land</h3><ul class=\"idx-bands__list\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><li class=\"idx-band\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"idx-band__count\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>2</span><span class=\"idx-band__name\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Leaders</span><span class=\"idx-band__range\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>40 and above</span></li><li class=\"idx-band\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"idx-band__count\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>18</span><span class=\"idx-band__name\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Contenders</span><span class=\"idx-band__range\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>25 to 39</span></li><li class=\"idx-band\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"idx-band__count\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>29</span><span class=\"idx-band__name\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Foundation</span><span class=\"idx-band__range\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>15 to 24</span></li><li class=\"idx-band\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"idx-band__count\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>10</span><span class=\"idx-band__name\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>At the tracking floor</span><span class=\"idx-band__range\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>exactly 14</span></li><li class=\"idx-band\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"idx-band__count\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>4</span><span class=\"idx-band__name\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Below the tracking threshold</span><span class=\"idx-band__range\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>no measurable presence</span></li></ul></div><p class=\"idx-findings__source\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Source: The AI Visibility Index, July 2026 edition (fintech and AI), Legency Media. 63 brands, worldwide, scored on AI visibility across the four engines named above. Full per-company scores and category benchmarks sit in the edition itself.</p></div></section><section class=\"section idx-programme\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"container idx-programme__inner\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The Programme</span><h2 class=\"idx-programme__heading\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>One Vertical at a Time</h2><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The Index is a standing research programme rather than a one-off study. Each edition takes a single category, scores the brands competing inside it, and publishes the shape of the field.</p><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The July 2026 edition covers fintech and AI, a category whose buying questions are unusually well defined, which makes it a clean first measurement. Later editions take other B2B categories. Our <a href=\"/industries/fintech-ai/\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>fintech and AI</a> engagements draw on the same data.</p><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>More verticals follow as editions publish. The question set stays stable between runs, so a score that shifts between editions shifted because the answers shifted. Every edition carries the month it was measured, and any question added to the set gets noted in it.</p></div></section><section class=\"section idx-cta-band\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"idx-cta\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Your Score</span><h2 class=\"idx-cta__heading\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Get your company's breakdown</h2><p class=\"idx-cta__text\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>We will pull your score, the scores of the companies answering the same buying questions in your category, and the three moves that would change yours. It runs on the same four-engine panel we work from every month for clients, across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude. Twenty minutes, and there is no charge for it.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/schedule/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get Your Company&#39;s Breakdown</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>What Is an AI Visibility Index?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>An AI visibility index compares a defined set of brands using a recorded source, market and date. Our July 2026 edition uses Semrush AI Visibility scores for 63 fintech and AI brands. Scores run from 0 to 100; they are a provider-defined index, not a percentage of every AI answer.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>How Is AI Visibility Measured?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>This edition uses Semrush AI Visibility scores from July 2026, alongside category benchmarks and market comparisons. A score is a provider-defined index, not the share of every AI answer. Our separate client panel records dated answers to selected buyer questions and distinguishes a brand mention from a linked citation.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>How Often Is the Index Refreshed?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>The published edition was measured in July 2026. A future edition will carry its own date, source, market and coverage. Compare editions only after checking whether those inputs changed; this page does not present the July scores as current live results.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Can My Company Be Included?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q><p data-astro-cid-mgvpjy2q>Yes. Tell us your category and we will pull your score, the scores of the companies answering the same buying questions, and the three moves that would change yours. It takes 20 minutes and there is no charge for it.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".page-brief[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{background:var(--white,#fff);border-block:1px solid #0c0c141f;pad